== History==
This spell was used by [[Zhalia Moon]] to foresee actions taken by a group of [[Suits]] to avoid and intercept their attacks during a battle in the [[Paris Catacombs]] whilst trying to escape with the supposed [[Ring of Arc]]. [[Mr. MacTavish]] recognized the powers as those of an [[Organization]] [[Seeker]] but rendered unconscious before he could continue. {{source|Divide and Conquer}}

Zhalia used the spell against [[Sophie Casterwill]] in the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]], allowing her to overpower her. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}

Zhalia used the spell to fight off [[Unnamed Suit 047]] inside [[King Solomon's mines]]. {{source|To Be Together}}

During the attack on [[the Professor's castle]], Zhalia and an elite [[Suit]] both used the spell on each other, which let them to simultaneously dodge each other's attacks. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

Zhalia used the spell against Sophie at the Vlad's Castle again, this time whilst posing as a [[Silent Soldier]]. {{source|Lok's Leadership}}

[[Grier]] used the spell whilst fighting [[Wilder]] in the Professor's private room. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}

== Trivia ==
*It is similar in effect to [[Sentry Triclops]]' "precognitive dodge" ability.

